        "note": "The 17,748-row expected output: THC, CO and NOx at running exhaust (road types 1 to 5; 1,790 rows each) and start exhaust (road type 1; 358 each), and NMHC and the five PM2.5 pollutants (1,570 and 314 each, no electricity rows), model years 1980-2020. The LEV-rated cohorts' cells carry LEV rates.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
