        "metaparameter": "n_runspecpollutantprocess"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "18 rows: THC, CO, NOx, NMHC, the PM2.5 total, EC, sulfate, NonECPM and aerosol water, each at running (x01) and start (x02) exhaust. Ten of them -- THC, CO, NOx, EC and NonECPM -- read emissionRateByAge, the ten the LEV template copies; the LEV database built here holds rows at six (THC, CO and NOx). The LEV table's EC and NonECPM rows are all at model-year group 45 (2025), so none is kept here and the PM2.5 group of a 2020 run reads default rates (`userdb-lev-2025` reads them).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
